{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Skill Up!",
    "steam_appid": 2850240,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Up is a satisfying 3D Jump &amp; Run experience with a stage based progression system. In each stage, you must reach the goal without falling down! Each stage comes with a unique concept and hurdles that have to be mastered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large variety of colorful, unique stages. Stages contain classic platformer elements and other unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfectly synchronized systems that behave identically on every run. Speed running has never been fairer or easier! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional mastery: After completing a stage, it can be played again to master it. This time, you shall not stop moving until reaching the goal! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Up is a satisfying 3D Jump &amp; Run experience with a stage based progression system. In each stage, you must reach the goal without falling down! Each stage comes with a unique concept and hurdles that have to be mastered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large variety of colorful, unique stages. Stages contain classic platformer elements and other unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfectly synchronized systems that behave identically on every run. Speed running has never been fairer or easier! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional mastery: After completing a stage, it can be played again to master it. This time, you shall not stop moving until reaching the goal! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Skill Up is a colorful 3D jump and run game where you progress through a large variety of unique stages. Just reach the goal; and don't fall down!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Indonesian<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
